          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "$\\mathrm{Zn}+\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{ZnSO}_{4}+\\mathrm{H}_{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{Zn}+2 \\mathrm{NaOH} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Na}_{2} \\mathrm{ZnO}_{2}+\\mathrm{H}_{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ Ratio of volumes of $\\mathrm{H}_{2}$ evolved is 1: 1",
